Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:13.24,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,BALAS BUDI TAK DIHARAP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wanita adalah aset keluarga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serta objek untuk pertukaran dan pemberian.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.66,0:00:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak boleh memiliki kehendak\Ndalam pernikahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tetapi, diriku...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan kehendakku sendiri\Nmemilih untuk mencintai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}orang yang tidak boleh kucintai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku merasa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}begitu bahagia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.73,0:02:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pernikahan Kunang-kunang
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}He-Hei!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.87,0:02:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan dilihat terus, kerja sana!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.75,0:02:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Habisnya, dia jarang keluar dari rumah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma sekarang kita bisa memandanginya!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.09,0:02:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih sudah bekerja keras.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Iya...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cantiknya luar biasa...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:48.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayunda!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.15,0:02:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan jalan-jalan ke luar begitu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.65,0:02:55.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jantung Ayunda itu lemah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.36,0:02:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau sampai pingsan saat\Nacara perjodohan besok, bisa gawat, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:02:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perjodohan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.91,0:03:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perjodohan dengan Tuan Hatano itu, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan Ayunda merasa\Ntidak enak padaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudahlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Toh yang dia pilih adalah Ayunda.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Miwako...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan bersedih.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.09,0:03:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayahanda sudah menolak perjodohan itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.51,0:03:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, padahal dia dari keluarga terpandang?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya apa yang kurang menurut Ayahanda?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tujuanku adalah menikah dengan pasangan\Nyang dikehendaki Ayahanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.48,0:03:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menyedihkan sekali kalau seperti itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kudengar rakyat jelata
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.27,0:03:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bisa bebas menjalin asmara,\Ntidak seperti kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bikin iri saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.41,0:03:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal kukira aku dan Tuan Hatano\Njuga bisa menjalin hubungan seperti itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.41,0:03:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau ada yang mau kamu sampaikan,\Nkatakanlah dengan jelas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bunga itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.88,0:03:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayunda yang tanam\Nuntuk ulang tahun Ayahanda, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan cari muka seperti itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.26,0:04:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kasih sayang Ayahanda,\Nbahkan calon suamiku pun
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mau Ayunda rebut semuanya, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Miwako...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tega sekali kamu menuduhku ingin merebut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah kamu saja yang tidak terpilih?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pria yang mengajukan perjodohan\Npasti tidak tahu, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.41,0:04:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soal berapa lama lagi\Njantung Ayunda bisa bertahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya pelayan tidak sengaja melihatnya\Nwaktu membersihkan kamar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Surat wasiat Ayunda.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar bisa hidup sedikit lebih lama,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mulai sekarang diam saja di kamar, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kuberi tahu satu hal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pihak sanalah\Nyang mengajukan perjodohan itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selagi kamu hanya bermain-main\Ntanpa berlatih dan belajar,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku selalu berusaha\Ntampil anggun dan cantik.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Juga memperluas wawasanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.19,0:04:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Usaha keras itulah yang terbayarkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:05:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena menjadi beban bagi keluarga ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku selalu berusaha\Nmembuktikan bahwa diriku berharga.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sok kuat banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.45,0:05:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daripada itu, lebih baik kamu\Nmengkhawatirkan dirimu sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena dirimu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:16.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}selain soal penampilan,\Nkamu kalah dari siapa pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa katamu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.01,0:05:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ditambah sifatmu itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.43,0:05:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pasti tidak akan pernah bisa menikah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, berjuanglah semampumu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.51,0:05:29.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurang ajar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kulaporkan ke Ibunda!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku agak keterlaluan, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.61,0:05:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masuk ke rumah saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak lama setelah aku lahir,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ibuku meninggal dan Ayah menikah lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat ini kami
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:06:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tinggal berempat dengan Miwako,\Nanak Ayah dari ibu tiriku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku terlahir dengan badan yang lemah
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan dokter pun mengatakan\Nbahwa aku tidak akan berumur panjang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.26,0:06:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku yang seperti ini malah\Nmendapat tawaran perjodohan,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.27,0:06:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Miwako pasti tidak bisa menerimanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang membenciku melebihi Miwako\Nadalah ibu tiriku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia menganggapku telah\Nmenghalangi pernikahan Miwako.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu-satunya yang memihakku di rumah ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayahanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.87,0:06:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bertengkar lagi sama Miwako?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:41.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Habisnya Miwako selalu membuatku marah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya dia sudah tumbuh\Njadi gadis yang begitu bandel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.84,0:06:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada tawaran perjodohan lagi untukmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.27,0:06:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia putra dari sahabatku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maukah kamu bertemu dengannya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:07:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa dia sudah diberi tahu\Nsoal kondisi tubuhku?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.19,0:07:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tahu, pasti tidak akan\Nberpikir untuk bertemu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, aku tidak ingin membohongi orang lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Agar dirimu bisa dapat penanganan dokter\Nyang memadai dan hidup dengan bahagia,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.63,0:07:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kamu perlu sandaran hidup dan uang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.38,0:07:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin aku terdengar cerewet\Nkarena terus membahas perjodohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.39,0:07:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, aku tidak bisa berhenti\Nmengharapkan kebahagiaanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untungnya kamu dikaruniai\Nnama keluarga Kirigaya dan paras cantik.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pasti akan bertemu dengan pria\Nyang akan mencintai dan melindungimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh, jangan bahas soal tampang,\Nitu bikin malu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.70,0:07:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak percaya pada sisa usia\Nyang dikatakan dokter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.87,0:08:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pasti akan terus hidup,\Naku percaya itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.75,0:08:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayahanda...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.96,0:08:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejak aku kecil,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.69,0:08:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}beliau selalu mengkhawatirkan kondisi tubuhku\Nlebih dari siapa pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harapan Ayahanda adalah\Naku menikah dan hidup bahagia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanya itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}meminang wanita yang sakit-sakitan\Ndan merepotkan untuk dirawat,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.69,0:08:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pasti tidak ada satu pria pun yang mau.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.19,0:08:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kupikirkan dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:31.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong, Ayahanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:34.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bolehkah aku pergi sebentar ke kota?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.87,0:08:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke kota?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.87,0:08:37.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada perlu apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, macam-macam!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.75,0:08:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, badanmu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.38,0:08:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kuajak Kotaro juga, boleh, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh, kamu ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah Ayahanda mau memberi izin,\Niya, kan, Kotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.06,0:08:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, ini tempatnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.56,0:09:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa berikan aku waktu sebentar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, saya akan melaksanakan\Ntugas yang diminta Tuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.94,0:09:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.07,0:09:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hindari terkena sinar matahari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong jangan terlalu capek juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita langsung pulang\Nkalau kondisi Anda memburuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong jangan ke mana-mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh, Kotaro ini terlalu khawatir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagusnya yang mana, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bunganya cerah,\Njadi vasnya kupilih yang polos saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.85,0:09:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanti tinggal ditata dengan cantik...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya, memang kasihan\Nkalau harus dipetik.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.40,0:09:48.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuperlihatkan saja pada Ayahanda\Nselagi masih tertanam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski jadi kurang seperti hadiah,\Nbunga ini juga makhluk hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mengharapkan kebahagiaanmu...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.37,0:09:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pernikahan, ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau menerima penyakitku,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}juga disetujui oleh Ayah\Ndan bisa saling mencintai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Andai saja ada orang seperti itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:13.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi-lagi aku banyak maunya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal tidak tahu\Napakah ada orang seperti itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tanggal 27 Juni.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.39,0:10:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Satoko, sudah waktunya...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.73,0:10:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pada hari ini, aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}diculik oleh para pria tidak dikenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.95,0:10:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pernikahan Kunang-kunang
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gadis ini, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.41,0:10:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lumayan cantik juga ternyata.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.04,0:10:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa orang-orang ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mataku tadi ditutup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini di mana?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.13,0:10:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Goto ke mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pas sekali dia sudah kembali.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.76,0:10:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:18.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kau habisi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.16,0:11:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Si berengsek yang membuat kami kesusahan\Nbisa dihabisi dalam satu hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya benar kalau kau\Ndisebut sebagai legenda atau apalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang aku ingin\Nmemberimu satu pekerjaan lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.80,0:11:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisakah kau habisi wanita ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanya saja klien bilang\Njangan buru-buru dibunuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, untuk sementara awasi saja dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, bunuh dia setelah jam sembilan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayang sekali padahal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.77,0:11:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, klien kali ini\Nsepertinya lumayan baik hati.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bayarannya sangat banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian jangan coba-coba\Nmemerkosa wanita ini, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.21,0:12:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau berani melakukannya,\Nakan kusuruh dia mencincang kalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Ya...\N- Baik...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.63,0:12:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu dia bicara kurang ajar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya aku jadi kesal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.65,0:12:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sudah berbuat apa sampai akan dibunuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.76,0:13:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau ini wanita yang cantik sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanya saja, saking pucatnya,\Nsampai mirip hantu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa sebenarnya pria ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seharusnya dia sedang menatapku,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.39,0:13:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi seakan tidak jelas\Ndia melihat ke mana...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seram...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.15,0:13:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.02,0:13:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Aku tidak melakukan apa pun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini salah paham!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.95,0:13:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keluarkan aku dari sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.45,0:13:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak bisa kalau itu,\Nsoalnya tugasku adalah membunuhmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana ini?\NAku harus berusaha kabur.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tidak salah, nanti jam sembilan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa tidak ada caranya agar aku selamat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.63,0:13:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau punya uang lebih banyak dari\Norang-orang yang mempekerjakanku di sini,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku mau saja membantumu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.85,0:13:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau hanya dia yang ada di pihakku,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}apa dia bisa melawan orang sebanyak itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.56,0:13:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Izinkan aku mempekerjakanmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang aku memang tidak punya uang,\Ntapi setelah pulang...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:13:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak percaya padamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.32,0:13:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, kimono ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kutolak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Toh bayaran di sini lebih menguntungkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.61,0:14:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya ampun...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, bocah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.49,0:14:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Minggir dari situ!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.49,0:14:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sip, jangan berisik, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hentikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.80,0:14:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yakin tidak masalah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak masalah asal tidak ketahuan,\Ntoh dia...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.51,0:14:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.64,0:14:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar binal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.85,0:14:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pegang yang kencang,\Nbakal cepat kuselesaikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.23,0:14:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini parah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.31,0:14:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kehilangan kesucian,\Njangankan mimpi menikah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayahanda...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin membalas budi Ayahanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:48.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin mewujudkan keinginannya\Nagar aku menikah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal, itulah tujuan hidupku...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.54,0:14:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau mati sebelum bisa\Nmenyenangkan orang tua...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:15:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa artinya aku terlahir kalau begitu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.50,0:15:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, hei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku disuruh menebas orang\Nyang berani menyentuh wanita ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.55,0:15:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh kutebas tidak?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berisik amat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan sok, Bocah,\Nmentang-mentang disebut legenda...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tu-Tunggu dulu!\NDia masih belum diapa-apakan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.61,0:15:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tiap kali kalian menyentuh wanita ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.61,0:15:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}akan kupotong tangan\Ndan kaki kalian satu per satu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.16,0:15:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo pikirkan bagaimana caranya\Nagar bisa keluar dengan selamat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku masih ingin hidup!\NAku tidak ingin menyerah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.67,0:15:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harus kubuat pria ini memihakku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harus kubuat dia menganggap diriku\Nlayak dibiarkan hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa saja, asalkan bernilai.\NApa pun yang kumiliki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bernilai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.85,0:15:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untung saja aku dikaruniai\Nnama keluarga Kirigaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:15:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diriku sendiri sudah bernilai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau bersamaku,\Ndirimu akan mendapat segalanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.61,0:16:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo kita menikah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.99,0:16:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menikah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.75,0:16:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku telah jatuh hati padamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lucu juga ucapanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayahku seorang bangsawan,\Naku putri darah biru yang terhormat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.80,0:16:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kau mau menikahiku, seumur hidup\Nkau tidak akan kesulitan soal nafkah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya apa yang kau suka dariku?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.05,0:16:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, anu...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.51,0:16:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau orang yang tepat waktu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.43,0:16:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}La-Lalu...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.89,0:16:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau mau berbagi nasi kepal denganku?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.69,0:16:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Nak!\NApa yang kau lakukan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.15,0:16:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka mau memerkosa wanita ini,\Nmakanya kutebas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.70,0:16:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah gila kau, ya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dibilang jangan berani sentuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.70,0:16:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?! Toh dia bakal dibunuh, kan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.29,0:16:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tinggal diam saja kalau diperkosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:17:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ini saja tidak ketahuan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.51,0:17:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian semua ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerja yang lebih serius, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang mau dia lakukan...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berengsek kau, Goto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.07,0:17:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, dia masih hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke, sekarang aku ingin dengar\Nlanjutan omonganmu tadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.87,0:17:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tertarik soal pernikahannya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong aku!\NAkan kubalas dengan menikahimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.08,0:17:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti, pernikahan tanpa cinta, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah wajarnya begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia sendiri tujuannya uang, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.13,0:17:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja, meski bukan menikah,\Njika aku bisa berguna...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.34,0:17:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.18,0:17:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebelah sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cewek binal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.14,0:17:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kuperkosa kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka sudah menyusul?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.27,0:18:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ayo kita buat ikatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.73,0:18:06.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ikatan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sini, cium aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau jatuh hati padaku, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.53,0:18:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apalagi kita akan menikah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anu, kesucian itu harus dijaga\Nsampai menikah...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.12,0:18:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ciuman juga termasuk...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya kesucian\Nlebih berharga daripada nyawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soal ciuman,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kalau kau tidak mau,\Nsebenarnya juga tidak masalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.41,0:19:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau aku menolak?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tinggal kubunuh pada waktu yang ditentukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu hening hingga terasa ganjil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang terdengar hanya debaran jantungku.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.85,0:19:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Debaran kencang ini menyuruhku untuk lari.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.53,0:19:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sampai menolak sekeras itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.20,0:19:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti jatuh hati tadi cuma bohong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.78,0:19:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayang sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.20,0:19:44.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bu-Bukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Takut sama aku?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti baru pertama kali\Nmelihat darah sebanyak ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enak sekali orang kaya bisa hidup nyaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti tidak perlu cemas\Nsama masa depan juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.76,0:20:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya kamu tahu apa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.83,0:20:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Darah orang lain masuk ke mulut itu\Ntidak higienis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.17,0:20:37.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ini tidak punya masa depan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.72,0:20:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jantungku tidak sehat\Ndan hidupku tidak akan lama lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.55,0:20:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tiap hari aku hidup dengan tekad di hati!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.69,0:20:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo menikah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.57,0:20:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak kusangka kau akan menciumku\Nsetelah melihatku menebas orang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau memang yang terbaik!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ini para wanita langsung lari\Nbegitu tahu pekerjaanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi harus kubunuh\Nuntuk menutup mulut mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, kau malah menerimanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti kaulah jodohku!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cintaku ini sedikit posesif,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi akan kubahagiakan kau.
